    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Floor Area : 65.98 sqm\nFlynn Estate Agents are delighted to present this bright and spacious own door two-bed apartment located in one of the most sought after developments in Clonsilla. Number 29 presents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors, or those seeking to create a home tailored to their own style and needs.\n\nAccommodation briefly comprises entrance hall, bright and spacious living room with feature fireplace, fully fitted kitchen with tiled floor and ample amount of fitted units. Off the hallway there are two large bedrooms with master benefitting from an en-suite and a fully fitted bathroom completing the accommodation. \n\nSituated just off the Clonsilla Road, the location is most convenient being a short stroll from Clonsilla Village and just a 5 minute drive to Blanchardstown Shopping Centre, with every conceivable amenity available. Coolmine Train Station is just a 10 minute walk, as well as the no. 37 bus stop, providing easy access to Dublin City Centre. The M50 and M3 are also a short drive away, making commuting to and from the city, as well as further afield, an ease.\n\nViewing is reccomended!!\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 1.63m (5'4\") x 1.39m (4'7\")\nwith laminate wood floor, alarm panel, hot press\n\nLounge - 6.07m (19'11\") x 4.18m (13'9\")\nwith laminate wood floor, feature fireplace\n\nKitchen - 2.23m (7'4\") x 2.68m (8'10\")\nwith a range of floor & eye level fitted press units with tiled splashback, fridge freezer, dishwasher, oven, hob & extractor fan.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.73m (12'3\") x 3.47m (11'5\")\nmaster bedroom with built in wardrobes.\n\nEnsuite - 1.19m (3'11\") x 2.27m (7'5\")\nwith w.c., w.h.b., shower cubicle with pumped shower, partially tiled\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.63m (8'8\") x 3.47m (11'5\")\nwith built in wardrobes.\n\nMain Bathroom - 1.72m (5'8\") x 1.1m (3'7\")\nwith w.c., w.h.b., & bath with shower attachment, partially tiled\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Gas Fired Central Heating </li><li> Double Glazed Windows </li><li> Excellent Location </li><li> Own Door Access </li><li> Newly installed gas boiler </li><li> Chain Free Sale </li><li> Management Fee 1,151 Approx</li></ul>"
